  acceptOption: "C\u1EE9 g\u1ECDi l\xE0 \xF4 k\xEA"
  acceptAnswer: Thanks, bro, I really appreciate your help.
  acceptAnswerClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b4b1be0518094644bcc298bbfe0a20d, type: 3}
  declineOption: "T\xF4i kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 "
  declineAnswer: I see. If you have a change of mind, please come back here.
  declineAnswerClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca59245cddb525b4eb891d095f973c36, type: 3}
  comebackAfterDecline: Have you changed your mind?
  comebackAfterDeclineClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5034ced520d551e43a4c93b28c1772bd, type: 3}
  comebackInProgress: Are you having any problems? I'm still waiting.
  comebackInProgressClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6b547667e4b29444a629c6a0e133e5b, type: 3}
  comebackCompleted: Well done, and this is your reward, or do you want a special
    reward? Just kidding, haha.
  comebackCompletedClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a104ed746d4fae94f9092397028045b9, type: 3}
  finalWords: Rabbit meat is delicious, but they are so cute, I can't bring myself
    to kill them. Thank you for your help.
